-- Stratholme, live side (map 329): Dathrohan fix. Re-export of 20261024020100_world.sql from turtle-agent
-- ef83bc5 (dungeons/stratholme_live.json) with the SAME options as that file's header:
--   turtle-agent plan-export --mmaps <map 329 mmaps> --allow-draft --gm-cross-direct --approach-hops \
--     --rev ef83bc5 --stamp 20261024060700 --out <dir> stratholme_live
-- The run leader only counts a corpse of the boss step's entry as boss down, and Dathrohan (10812) never leaves one:
-- below 40%% he UpdateEntry-transforms into Balnazzar (10813) on the same creature, same GUID
-- (boss_dathrohan_balnazzar.cpp:251), so r28c paused on 'boss 10812 not found' after ~40 s of fighting. The boss
-- step's entry is now Balnazzar 10813 (same spot 3413.63 -3042.04 136.534: UpdateEntry keeps the spawn) with Dathrohan
-- 10812 in first, so both drivers order the Dathrohan phase (kill order 16101, 16102, 10812, then 10813) and track the
-- same GUID across the transform; Balnazzar's death ends the step. Leg 1 stays a move and the boss step (2 rows);
-- 195 steps (141 moves, 51 pulls: 42 + 0 + 9; 3 bosses), 199 rows, unchanged counts.
-- The boss block (ai_dungeon_boss, the pattern of 20261021114931_world.sql) is added by hand: the exporter does not
-- write that table. 10813 (Balnazzar, rank 1 elite, creature_template) is seeded; the DELETE stays scoped to this
-- plan's boss-step entries, so the 10812 row of 20261024020100_world.sql and stratholme_undead's five keep theirs.
-- Nothing else changed: no gate after Willey and no Timmy 10808 step, see below.
-- INTERACTIONS-VERIFIED-2026-10-24.md (2026-10-24) has NO stratholme_live section: the file covers blackfathom_deeps,
-- shadowfang_keep, dragonmaw_retreat, razorfen_kraul, gnomeregan, sunken_temple, blackrock_depths, windhorn_canyon,
-- crescent_grove, maraudon_purple/orange, stormwind_vault, scholomance, dire_maul_east and hateforge_quarry only.
-- Neither the 'gate after Willey' nor Timmy the Cruel 10808 appears anywhere in it, so neither is marked BLOCKS and
-- neither is added. Per RUN-LESSONS.md r28c: 'No gate or Timmy interaction was exercised' in the full 195-step run,
-- which reached Cannon Master Willey (step 195) with no gate stop and no Timmy stop.

-- Dungeon plans for the run leader (.bot run), exported by turtle-agent (plan-export). Plan format v1; the mapping is
-- docs/guides/dungeon-run-leader.md ("From plan v1 to rows"). The plan file in turtle-agent is the single source: edit it
-- there and export again, never these rows by hand. The plan row carries the unit lists cc_priority, cc_always and kill_first
-- (columns from 20261015200000_world.sql). Never edit this file once applied; export a new one.
--
-- Idempotent: each plan's rows are deleted, then inserted. The tables come from 20261014150000_world.sql.

-- stratholme_live: map 329, 3 legs, 195 steps
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_step` WHERE `plan` = 'stratholme_live';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_leg` WHERE `plan` = 'stratholme_live';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_plan` WHERE `plan` = 'stratholme_live';

-- ai_dungeon_boss for the plan's three boss-step entries (map 329's live side; entry-scoped so stratholme_undead's
-- five keep theirs, and the 10812 row of 20261024020100_world.sql keeps its own: Dathrohan is still a boss, the step
-- just ends on his second form).
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_boss` WHERE `map` IN (329) AND `entry` IN (10811, 10813, 10997);
